# Pairs with ScopelessFromClusterWideOnly: a prefix rule on the cluster-wide id matches the scopeless request, conferring AppInstall.

MODULE: PrefixOnClusterWideConfers
TARGET: ScopelessFromClusterWideOnly
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a prefix rule on the cluster-wide id matches the scopeless request, conferring AppInstall

--- FIND
    /\ \/ r.kind = "tree"
--- REPLACE
    /\ \/ r.kind = "tree" \/ r.tree = ClusterWideTreeId
--- END
